---
import Footer from '../components/Footer.astro';
import { SEO } from 'astro-seo';
---
<html lang="en">
<head>
	<meta charset="UTF-8">
	<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
	<meta name="author" content="HuiBeom Jung"/>
	<meta name="keywords" content="LightersGames,Privacy Policy,Data Protection,GDPR,Personal Information"/>
	<SEO 
		title="Privacy Policy - LightersGames"
		description="Privacy Policy for LightersGames and ThanksLight. Learn how we collect, use, and protect your personal information."
		canonical="https://lightersgames.com/privacy-policy"
		openGraph={{
			basic: {
				title: "Privacy Policy - LightersGames",
				type: "website",
				image: "/img/trailer-img.png",
				url: "https://lightersgames.com/privacy-policy"
			},
			image: {
            alt: "LightersGames Privacy Policy"  
			},
			optional: {
				description: "Privacy Policy for LightersGames and ThanksLight. Learn how we collect, use, and protect your personal information."
			}
		}}
	/>
	<meta property="twitter:description" content="Privacy Policy for LightersGames and ThanksLight. Learn how we collect, use, and protect your personal information.">
	<meta itemprop="description" content="Privacy Policy for LightersGames and ThanksLight. Learn how we collect, use, and protect your personal information.">
	<link rel="icon" type="image/png" sizes="40x40" href="/favicon-40x40.png" />
	<style is:global>
		@import "../styles/base.css";
	</style>
	<script defer data-domain="lightersgames.com" src="/js/script.js"></script>
	<script>window.plausible = window.plausible || function() { (window.plausible.q = window.plausible.q || []).push(arguments) }</script>
</head>
<body>
	<main>
		<div id="content">
			<h1>Privacy Policy</h1>
			<p><em>Last updated: 2025/6/26</em></p>
			
			<h2>Introduction</h2>
			<p>
				LightersGames Inc. ("we," "our," or "us") is committed to protecting your privacy. This Privacy Policy explains how we collect, use, and protect your data when you play our games. By downloading or using our games, you agree to this policy.
			</p>

			<h2>Information We Collect</h2>
			<h3>Personal Information</h3>
			<p>
				We may collect your email, or contact details (only if you contact us), and your purchase history (if linked to an account on supported platforms).
			</p>

			<h3>Non-Personal Information</h3>
			<p>
				We may collect your device information (model, OS version, IP address), gameplay data (game progress, achievements, in-game purchases), and crash logs, to improve stability.
			</p>
			
			<h3>Cookies & Tracking Technologies</h3>
			<p>
				Third-party platforms (ex. Steam, PlayStation, Microsoft, Epic Games) may use cookies or tracking tools when you access our games.
			</p>

			<h2>How We Use Your Information</h2>
			<p>We use the collected data to:</p>
			<ul>
				<li>Provide and improve our games.</li>
				<li>Analyze player behavior for better game design.</li>
				<li>Communicate with you about updates and announcements.</li>
				<li>Save game progress and preferences.</li>
				<li>Process purchases and in-game transactions.</li>
			</ul>

			<h2>Third-Party Services & Data Sharing</h2>
			<p>
				We do not sell or trade your personal data. However, our games may integrate with third-party services:
			</p>
			
			<h3>Unreal Engine</h3>
			<p>
				Games built with Unreal Engine may collect device information, game performance data, and crash reports.
				Epic Games, which owns Unreal Engine, may collect additional analytics and usage data.
				<li>Unreal Engine Privacy Policy: https://www.epicgames.com/site/en-US/privacypolicy.</li>
			</p>
			
			<h3>Steam, Itch.io, PlayStation, Nintendo, Microsoft Store, Epic Games Store</h3>
			<p>
				If you play via these platforms, they may collect purchase data, cloud saves, and social interactions. Please refer to their privacy policies:
				<li>Steam: https://store.steampowered.com/privacy_agreement/</li>
				<li>Itch.io: https://itch.io/docs/legal/privacy-policy</li>
				<li>PlayStation: https://www.playstation.com/legal/privacy-policy/</li>
				<li>Nintendo: https://www.nintendo.com/us/privacy-policy/</li>
				<li>Microsoft Store: https://privacy.microsoft.com/en-us/privacystatement</li>
				<li>Epic Games Store: https://www.epicgames.com/site/en-US/privacypolicy</li>
			</p>

			<h2>Children's Privacy</h2>
			<p>
				Our games are not intended for children under 13 without parental consent. We do not knowingly collect data from minors. 
				If you believe your child has shared personal information, contact us with the email below.
			</p>

			<h2>Security Measures</h2>
			<p>
				We take reasonable steps to protect your data, but no system is completely secure. Avoid sharing personal information in game.
			</p>
			
			<h2>Changes to This Policy</h2>
			<p>
				We may update this Privacy Policy. Any changes will be posted on this page. Please review periodically.
			</p>

			<h2>Contact Us</h2>
			<p>
				If you have questions about this Privacy Policy or our data practices, please contact us at:
			</p>
			<p>
				<strong>LightersGames Inc.</strong><br>
				Email: hb@lightersgames.com<br>
			</p>
		</div>
	</main>
	<Footer />
</body>
</html>

<style>
	main {
		background-color: #242424;
		position: relative;
		max-width: 1920px;
		margin: auto;
		padding-bottom: 4em;
		color: white;
	}

	#content {
		max-width: 80ch;
		margin: 0 auto;
		padding: 2ch;
		line-height: 1.6;
	}

	h1 {
		text-align: center;
		margin-bottom: 1em;
		font-size: 2.5em;
		font-weight: 300;
		letter-spacing: 2px;
	}

	h2 {
		margin-top: 2em;
		margin-bottom: 0.5em;
		font-size: 1.5em;
		font-weight: 400;
		color: #ffffff;
		border-bottom: 1px solid #444;
		padding-bottom: 0.25em;
	}

	h3 {
		margin-top: 1.5em;
		margin-bottom: 0.5em;
		font-size: 1.2em;
		font-weight: 400;
		color: #cccccc;
	}

	p {
		margin-bottom: 1em;
		text-align: left;
	}

	ul {
		margin-bottom: 1em;
		padding-left: 2em;
	}

	li {
		margin-bottom: 0.5em;
	}

	em {
		color: #aaaaaa;
		font-style: italic;
	}

	strong {
		font-weight: 600;
	}

	/* Responsive styles */
	@media screen and (max-width: 768px) {
		#content {
			padding: 1ch;
			max-width: 95%;
		}

		h1 {
			font-size: 2em;
		}

		h2 {
			font-size: 1.3em;
		}

		h3 {
			font-size: 1.1em;
		}
	}

	@media screen and (max-width: 500px) {
		#content {
			padding: 0.8ch;
		}

		h1 {
			font-size: 1.8em;
			letter-spacing: 1px;
		}
	}
</style>